        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grant_Town%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grant Town serves as the setting for several stories in the West Virginia ghost story anthology called The Telltale Lilac Bush.",
